[
  {
    "page": 7,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 269.92,
    "end": 270.3,
    "duration": 0.38,
    "text": "Ah!"
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 2,
    "start": 273.46,
    "end": 274.84,
    "duration": 1.38,
    "text": "Oh my God."
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 4,
    "start": 276.92,
    "end": 278.72,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "text": "Oh, oh my God."
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 8,
    "start": 281.1,
    "end": 285.2,
    "duration": 4.1,
    "text": "Parkes is showing her where he used to have the caravan. Somebody\u2019s taken his spot apparently."
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 16,
    "start": 292.34,
    "end": 293.36,
    "duration": 1.02,
    "text": "Well. Here we are."
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 18,
    "start": 294.48,
    "end": 300.44,
    "duration": 5.96,
    "text": "God that\u2019s a long drive, though. Monica almost passed out in the heat. Why are you looking at me like that?"
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "line": 26,
    "start": 319.7,
    "end": 320.68,
    "duration": 0.98,
    "text": "Just a little bit, yes."
  },
  {
    "page": 9,
    "line": 9,
    "start": 348.82,
    "end": 351.14,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "Penny, Penny, Penny!!! They could come in at any moment!"
  },
  {
    "page": 9,
    "line": 11,
    "start": 354.36,
    "end": 358.22,
    "duration": 3.86,
    "text": "I.....yes, of course....but.... I might have thought more seriously about the consequences."
  },
  {
    "page": 9,
    "line": 15,
    "start": 370.22,
    "end": 371.84,
    "duration": 1.62,
    "text": "You\u2019re talking very loudly."
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 3,
    "start": 403.98,
    "end": 405.9,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "We can\u2019t, can we?"
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 9,
    "start": 415.94,
    "end": 416.78,
    "duration": 0.84,
    "text": "I didn\u2019t say that."
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 13,
    "start": 433.2,
    "end": 433.9,
    "duration": 0.7,
    "text": "Twice a year?"
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 15,
    "start": 440.26,
    "end": 441.16,
    "duration": 0.9,
    "text": "I suppose not."
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 17,
    "start": 442.2,
    "end": 444.48,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Twice a year! Only twice a year?"
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 460.4,
    "end": 461.98,
    "duration": 1.58,
    "text": "I don\u2019t think we should talk about this."
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 25,
    "start": 463.66,
    "end": 464.74,
    "duration": 1.08,
    "text": "A bit more than that, yes."
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "line": 27,
    "start": 466.18,
    "end": 468.02,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "text": "About twice. A week."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 2,
    "start": 481.78,
    "end": 484.06,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "You\u2019re very attractive. Don\u2019t be silly."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 7,
    "start": 494.2,
    "end": 494.84,
    "duration": 0.64,
    "text": "Good for you."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 11,
    "start": 504.94,
    "end": 506.62,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "Oh. Go ahead then."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 13,
    "start": 507.12,
    "end": 508.82,
    "duration": 1.7,
    "text": "Were you disappointed with me?"
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 15,
    "start": 511.78,
    "end": 516.84,
    "duration": 5.06,
    "text": "Of course, I can\u2019t compete with surfies, I realise that, but I\u2019ve never had any complaints before."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 17,
    "start": 523.22,
    "end": 527.4,
    "duration": 4.18,
    "text": "I do. I do care. I\u2019m guilty, that\u2019s all. Adultery isn\u2019t easy, Penny."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 19,
    "start": 528.66,
    "end": 532.8,
    "duration": 4.14,
    "text": "It was a wonderful night. I did enjoy it. And I would have enjoyed it sober."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 22,
    "start": 535.54,
    "end": 536.52,
    "duration": 0.98,
    "text": "Where do we all sleep?"
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 24,
    "start": 543.4,
    "end": 544.88,
    "duration": 1.48,
    "text": "Monica and I will have to take the annexe."
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "line": 26,
    "start": 545.98,
    "end": 548.72,
    "duration": 2.74,
    "text": "I don\u2019t think we should sleep in here with you and Parkes do you?"
  },
  {
    "page": 12,
    "line": 1,
    "start": 556.7,
    "end": 559.12,
    "duration": 2.42,
    "text": "Oh, I\u2019m sure it will work itself out in time."
  },
  {
    "page": 12,
    "line": 6,
    "start": 581.2,
    "end": 585.96,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "Penny. You surprise me. You really surprise me."
  },
  {
    "page": 12,
    "line": 9,
    "start": 588.52,
    "end": 589.06,
    "duration": 0.54,
    "text": "Oh darling."
  },
  {
    "page": 12,
    "line": 11,
    "start": 590.9,
    "end": 592.52,
    "duration": 1.62,
    "text": "Darling, darling, darling."
  },
  {
    "page": 13,
    "line": 14,
    "start": 645.98,
    "end": 648.74,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "Monica, we are going to be in this caravan for two weeks...."
  },
  {
    "page": 13,
    "line": 16,
    "start": 649.62,
    "end": 654.9,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "This is only the first day. I would appreciate it very much if you would try to look on the bright side."
  },
  {
    "page": 13,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 665.04,
    "end": 667.5,
    "duration": 2.46,
    "text": "She exaggerates. There was one fly."
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "line": 1,
    "start": 686.24,
    "end": 688.92,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "She\u2019s always happy when she\u2019s got something to complain about."
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "line": 5,
    "start": 691.58,
    "end": 693.12,
    "duration": 1.54,
    "text": "You don\u2019t need another drink."
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "line": 7,
    "start": 698.96,
    "end": 704.6,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "text": "How many times do I have to say, this is not a camping holiday? This is a luxury caravan."
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "line": 9,
    "start": 705.38,
    "end": 709.62,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "An almost luxury caravan. You can\u2019t get better than this."
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 763.64,
    "end": 764.54,
    "duration": 0.9,
    "text": "That\u2019s certainly a blessing."
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "line": 6,
    "start": 795.72,
    "end": 797.58,
    "duration": 1.86,
    "text": "They\u2019re only cats for God\u2019s sake!"
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "line": 22,
    "start": 837.78,
    "end": 839.0,
    "duration": 1.22,
    "text": "Monica, don\u2019t be disgusting."
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "line": 5,
    "start": 864.68,
    "end": 865.98,
    "duration": 1.3,
    "text": "Monica, don\u2019t go on."
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "line": 9,
    "start": 877.28,
    "end": 881.26,
    "duration": 3.98,
    "text": "Monica, you never know when you\u2019ve gone too far. We\u2019ll sleep in the tent."
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "line": 11,
    "start": 887.32,
    "end": 888.5,
    "duration": 1.18,
    "text": "This isn\u2019t the outback."
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "line": 17,
    "start": 916.82,
    "end": 917.84,
    "duration": 1.02,
    "text": "I think I\u2019ll join you."
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "line": 14,
    "start": 945.16,
    "end": 949.12,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Oh? The caravan. We\u2019ve seen it before, Parkes. Very nice."
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "line": 14,
    "start": 1017.66,
    "end": 1018.34,
    "duration": 0.68,
    "text": "Where\u2019s Pierce?"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "line": 21,
    "start": 1029.26,
    "end": 1029.84,
    "duration": 0.58,
    "text": "Who\u2019s he bringing?"
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "line": 7,
    "start": 1066.06,
    "end": 1067.84,
    "duration": 1.78,
    "text": "He\u2019s always enjoyed our company before."
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "line": 13,
    "start": 1158.5,
    "end": 1164.16,
    "duration": 5.66,
    "text": "Of course we\u2019ll be nice to her. It\u2019s just disappointing that Pierce has brought her. This is our first holiday together ever."
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 1184.2,
    "end": 1185.26,
    "duration": 1.06,
    "text": "Don\u2019t overdo it, dear."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "line": 2,
    "start": 1319.44,
    "end": 1321.08,
    "duration": 1.64,
    "text": "No. You were a year ahead of me."
  },
  {
    "page": 28,
    "line": 2,
    "start": 1593.12,
    "end": 1593.9,
    "duration": 0.78,
    "text": "Yes, fine."
  },
  {
    "page": 28,
    "line": 4,
    "start": 1594.3,
    "end": 1595.42,
    "duration": 1.12,
    "text": "Will you behave yourself?"
  },
  {
    "page": 33,
    "line": 12,
    "start": 1971.6,
    "end": 1973.26,
    "duration": 1.66,
    "text": "Well, don\u2019t just stand there. Hold this."
  },
  {
    "page": 33,
    "line": 23,
    "start": 1986.74,
    "end": 1988.5,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "Don\u2019t just stand there, Pierce."
  },
  {
    "page": 34,
    "line": 11,
    "start": 2008.56,
    "end": 2010.88,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "Oh god. Oh God."
  },
  {
    "page": 34,
    "line": 13,
    "start": 2012.82,
    "end": 2014.04,
    "duration": 1.22,
    "text": "Don\u2019t you laugh!"
  },
  {
    "page": 34,
    "line": 30,
    "start": 2041.96,
    "end": 2043.1,
    "duration": 1.14,
    "text": "I banged my head, too!"
  }
]